// NPC catalog. Lifted from the printed Torchbearer 2nd Edition books —
// the Scholar's Guide "Beasts with Two Legs" denizens chapter
// (pp.201–211), plus named-personality stat blocks scattered through
// scenarios (Beronin SG p.262).
//
// Per the canonical-book deep-link substrate, the catalog never
// reproduces rulebook prose — no flavor blurb, no description text.
// Each template carries a `pageRef` into one of the canonical TB2
// books. The NPC sheet renders `<BookCitation>` inline so the GM
// clicks through to their bound rulebook PDF.
//
// SG p.201 "Regular Folks": "While some might be monsters, they are
// just regular folks. Therefore, their Might is always 2." Every
// "Beasts with Two Legs" template below carries Might 2 accordingly;
// named personalities (Beronin) carry their printed Might.
//
// Skill name normalisation:
//   - "Manip" (printed shorthand on the Bard's row) → "manipulator"
//   - "Lore Master" → "loreMaster"
//   - All other names match their canonical skill ids in skills.ts.

